"name": "NP3 Fastigheter AB",
"description": "NP3 Fastigheter AB engages in the ownership and management of industrial, commercial, logistics, and office properties. It operates through the following geographical segments: Sundsvall, G\u00e4vle, Dalarna, \u00d6stersund, Ume\u00e5, Lule\u00e5, and Middle Sweden. The firm's property portfolios include shops, office hotels, offices, and warehouses. The company was founded by Yngeve Lars-G\u00f6ran B\u00e4ckvall, Rickard Alvar Emanuel Backlund, and Andreas Nelvig on December 27, 2007 and is headquartered in Sundsvall, Sweden.",
